-- `listItems(transport)` → every item, ordered by `id`.
+- `listItems(transport)` → every item, ordered by `id`. The API returns items
+  in pages, so this sends `GET /items` with no cursor first, then repeats it
+  with each `next_cursor` (passed back unchanged) until the cursor is `null`
+  or absent. It rejects on any failed page, or if the server repeats a cursor.
 - `getItem(transport, id)` → one item; rejects on any non-200 response.
 - `lowStock(items, threshold)` → SKUs with `qty` below the threshold.
 
